Falsifies `e1000e::ring_proofs::the_transmit_ring_never_writes_what_the_device_holds`.

The defect: transmit stops refusing a full ring, so with fifteen frames the device holds, a
sixteenth moves the tail onto the device's head. The device then reads its ring as empty and holds
none of the frames the driver sent.

Expected to fail: the harness's `assert!(device.held() == outstanding)`, after the sixteenth
frame.

